  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><iframe id=\"v2fd0QIrrkbMIBbIICyrM9b\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v2fd0QIrrkbMIBbIICyrM9b?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InYyZmQwUUlycmtiTUlCYklJQ3lyTTliIiwidGlkIjoiMGZmN2MzOWQtYzUzMS00YWE4LWEwZjQtYmNkZDlkNTY5MjhkIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMzQxfQ.e9Q7w8NI6xfksYqkBWN-T5RGP_lOxs7NPmbTHrelrgBB1ygzo8ponfak8RwomYlMx_sjHezyP1WduUKhHZR_Ug&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>소변을 증류해서 맑은 물 얻는 과정.... 결과는 실패입니다.</p><p>왜 실패했는지 아이들과 얘기하고 </p><p>성공의 비법을 찾아보는 것 재미있을 것 같습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"va808RRphThB8e5nnaha8aZ\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/va808RRphThB8e5nnaha8aZ?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZhODA4UlJwaFRoQjhlNW5uYWhhOGFaIiwidGlkIjoiZTY5ZTEyZjktYjhkZi00MDhjLWIyYjMtZTgxMTE5NGQxN2MxIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMzQxfQ.WXKesDhrJ9ZJJ6sE8x6jsROC1SpRdPuij7eCxL4gTK_BgUv3-esDbt4TFX4cWSudKFEZputu0jcB6It6tpA3Ow&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v7216rGGZA8ZTCDIIazJIa8\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v7216rGGZA8ZTCDIIazJIa8?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY3MjE2ckdHWkE4WlRDRElJYXpKSWE4IiwidGlkIjoiMzdmODIwZmItZjBmMi00OTJlLTk0NzUtZWMzM2MwZWE0NjU1IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMzQxfQ.qRFk8L27GWxDSN9favuhx7JLBdkwvi5GQsIwI5bn-4EZ7HaC0EKngw8iRNcYvHmCGArP61FOleEXp5rACtlprw&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v644bMFBLDLBndWFFbHnFKW\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v644bMFBLDLBndWFFbHnFKW?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY2NDRiTUZCTERMQm5kV0ZGYkhuRktXIiwidGlkIjoiNzIyYTVjYjEtNjA2OS00NDlhLWExN2UtOGFlOTAzMmI1MjJiIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMzQxfQ.XIsi62uQHXtMTK7cnPgwFnEXaT2qy4DC6AkUufaIQoNPi8YTVld37iZxajYVr_kOIVtxRaW6u8uYGmC6dhLOAA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v428eKKHKHKRRDxlluhHvID\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v428eKKHKHKRRDxlluhHvID?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY0MjhlS0tIS0hLUlJEeGxsdWhIdklEIiwidGlkIjoiOGYxNDg4NDItZmU1My00YWZlLWJmYjEtYTcxZjcxZWViNTllIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzMzQxfQ.tORj4VjxkXz8m6jXLU3uIUt_Dl3hXL4aLROAiSVlwe6d5kltbSBY3IzuHjQtcSM7XJV9-A0nzYciBuhZgAkQDA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>며칠째 과학실에서 수업중입니다.</p><p>분별깔때기 수업은 과학실 사정때문에 그냥 지나가고, 잉크물 증류하기, 질산칼륨과 염화나트륨 온도에 따른 용해도 차이 이용하여 분리하기, 크로마토 그래피 등 실험으로 진행하고 있어요. 실험이 간단하고, 또 끓이거나 냉각하는 시간 등 빈시간들을 활용하여 활동지도 채우게 합니다. ~</p><p><br></p><p>활동지 입니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D932%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20141024100508&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile249.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F277EE14F5449A4AA367B32')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 1. 밀도 차를 이용한 혼합물의 분리.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D932%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20141024100508&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile260.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2119D04F5449A4AB0F76B6')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 2.끓는점 차이를 이용한 혼합물의 분리.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D932%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20141024100508&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile278.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F251FD44F5449A4AC085EAE')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 3. 용해도 차이를 이용한 혼합물의 분리.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D932%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20141024100508&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile255.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F231B604F5449A4AD0D05E1')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 4. 크로마토그래피를 이용한 혼합물의 분리.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p>생활 속 혼합물 분리는 이제까지 배운 것, 실험한 것 등을 정리하는 동영상 제작을 할까 생각중입니다. ^^</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
